## What is not redistributed

| item | where it lives | in the wheel? |
|---|---|---|
| CANN runtime libraries (`libascendcl`, `libopapi`, …) | target machine's CANN install | **no** — runtime-linked |
| torch / torch_npu libraries | target machine's Python env | **no** — runtime-linked |
| `catlass-example-data/` (S1 anchor inputs/goldens) | this repository | **no** — repository test data |
| model weights, prompts | never stored here | **no** |

The packaging audit is mechanical: the wheel may contain only
`ascend_kernel/_C*.so`, `ascend_kernel/lib/libascend_kernel.so`, pure-Python
files, the dist-info metadata and the embedded `LICENSE` (see the kernel README
"链接纪律" and `docs/multi-operator-dev.md`).
